{"id":"6d2cda23f5f4d367","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision.md","title":"从独立集判定恢复最优独立集","display":"thm-independent-set-search-from-decision — 从独立集判定恢复最优独立集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision","aliases":["73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision"],"display":"thm-independent-set-search-from-decision — 从独立集判定恢复最优独立集","depends_on":["[[73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent]]","[[73-df-binary-p]]","[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2 boxed discussion, print p. 462; PDF p. 484; local search reconstruction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-independent-set-search-from-decision — 从独立集判定恢复最优独立集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63\" href=\"?note=cf2cc39a9b1c7b63\" title=\"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent\">73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0173e0f8c9568f2f\" href=\"?note=0173e0f8c9568f2f\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-string-functions\">73-df-polynomial-string-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2 boxed discussion, print p. 462; PDF p. 484; local search reconstruction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\">\\(f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbf2^n\">\\(s\\in\\mathbf2^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> 采用图编码定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span> 在下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_s\\coloneqq\\{i\\in V_n:s(i)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_s\\coloneqq\\{i\\in V_n:s(i)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{IS}\\in\\mathsf P\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall E\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longrightarrow\nf(\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E))\\in\n\\{s\\in\\mathbf2^n:\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S_s)\\}\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{IS}\\in\\mathsf P\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall E\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longrightarrow\nf(\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E))\\in\n\\{s\\in\\mathbf2^n:\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S_s)\\}\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先在 0..n 二分查询得到 α。逐个顶点 v 测试删去 v 后是否仍有同样大小的独立集；若有就删去 v，否则必须保留 v，删除它和所有邻点，目标数减一。至多 n 次恢复查询；子图重编号及逆映射均为多项式。教材 p.462 的框先讨论求最优大小，本条继续给出实际顶点集合的自归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent","status":"resolved","id":"cf2cc39a9b1c7b63","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-maximal-versus-maximum-independent]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-string-functions","status":"resolved","id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-string-functions]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbf2^n","display":false},{"tex":"V_n","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"S_s\\coloneqq\\{i\\in V_n:s(i)=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{IS}\\in\\mathsf P\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathsf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall E\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{UGraph}(n,E)\\Longrightarrow\nf(\\operatorname{GCode}^U(n,E))\\in\n\\{s\\in\\mathbf2^n:\\operatorname{MaximumInd}_{n,E}(S_s)\\}\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-independent-set-search-from-decision|从独立集判定恢复最优独立集]] （本轮新建）"}],"o